---
description: Rules for authoring and maintaining static analysis checks
globs: src/checks/**/*.mjs, test/checks/**/*.test.mjs
---

# Check Authoring Rules

- Every check must export `meta = { id, description, defaultOptions }` and `check(files, options)`.
- Match against `maskNonCode(file.text)` or `matchOutsideComments(file.text, pattern)`. Never run regex directly on raw text.
- Resolve imported local identifiers before assuming wrapper names (`importedGuardLocals`).
- Derive finding positions using `positionAt(file.text, offset)`.
- Support line-level exemptions using `lineHasInlineExemption(file.text, offset)`.
- Case table tests in `test/checks/*.test.mjs` must test both must-catch and must-pass cases, plus at least two near-misses.
